<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Harmony Beats - Music Band</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    background:#f4f4f4;
    color:#333;
    line-height:1.6;
}

header{
    background:#2c3e50;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

nav{
    background:#34495e;
    padding:15px;
    text-align:center;
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin:0 15px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:#f1c40f;
}

section{
    width:90%;
    margin:25px auto;
    background:white;
    padding:25px;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
}

h2{
    color:#2c3e50;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

img{
    max-width:100%;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.hero img{
    width:100%;
    height:500px;
    object-fit:cover;
}

.gallery{
    display:flex;
    gap:20px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.gallery img{
    width:300px;
    height:200px;
    object-fit:cover;
}

table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    margin-top:15px;
}

table,th,td{
    border:1px solid #333;
}

th{
    background:#2c3e50;
    color:white;
}

th,td{
    padding:10px;
    text-align:center;
}

audio,video{
    width:100%;
    margin-top:15px;
}

iframe{
    width:100%;
    height:400px;
    border:none;
}

progress{
    width:100%;
    height:25px;
}

fieldset{
    padding:20px;
    border:2px solid #2c3e50;
}

legend{
    font-weight:bold;
}

label{
    display:block;
    margin-top:10px;
}

input,
textarea,
select{
    width:100%;
    padding:10px;
    margin-top:5px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    border:1px solid #999;
    border-radius:5px;
}

input[type="submit"]{
    background:#2c3e50;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    cursor:pointer;
}

input[type="submit"]:hover{
    background:#1a252f;
}

footer{
    background:#2c3e50;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    margin-top:20px;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

.hero img{
height:250px;
}

.gallery img{
width:100%;
}

nav a{
display:block;
margin:10px;
}

}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Harmony Beats</h1>
<p>Music That Connects Everyone</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#albums">Albums</a>
<a href="#members">Members</a>
<a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
<a href="#media">Media</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">

<h2>Welcome to Harmony Beats</h2>

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501386761578-eac5c94b800a?w=1200" alt="Music Band">

<p>
Harmony Beats is a professional music band performing Pop, Rock,
Jazz and Acoustic music. We perform at weddings, college events,
corporate shows and music festivals.
</p>

</section>

<section id="about">

<h2>About Us</h2>

<p>
Harmony Beats was founded in 2020 by passionate musicians.
Our performances combine creativity, energy and entertainment.
We believe music has the power to connect people and create unforgettable memories.
</p>

<p>
Visit our
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@music_beatss-h9y" target="_blank">
Official YouTube Channel
</a>
</p>

</section>

